      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "If a²+b²+c²=138 and ab+bc+ca=131:\n(a+b+c)² = 138 + 2×131 = 400\n\nIf the numbers are positive, their sum is 20.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
